{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":40,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"65defcaf-62b0-4088-8881-ec31a1a21278","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190775811,"PostDateInt":1762758121000,"PostDate":"2025-11-10T15:02:01","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"可靠性工程师(J12238)","OrgId":700097329,"Org":"新能源动力事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·光明区"],"Salary":"12K-20K 元/月","Duty":"1、根据客户需求、国标、企标，制定测试方法及测试计划，推进DV、DVP可靠性测试，对试验进度及质量负责；\n2、定义和分析产品可靠性需求，识别产品可靠性风险，从产品的硬件选型、PCBA布局、产品结构、工艺等方面推进提高产品可靠性的专项研究；\n3、负责产品可靠性失效分析，能使用常用失效分析工具如FMEA、FAT等进行闭环分析；\n4、提炼可靠性设计、可靠性试验和问题分析经验，持续提升可靠性工程能力。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，机械工程、力学、电气工程、自动化等相关专业，3年以上可靠性设计或测试相关经验；\n2、熟悉常用的测试设备，熟悉常用的寿命加速模型及加速试验设计，如ALT、HALT、寿命测试、环境类测试等；\n3、掌握测试基本理论和方法，对测试风险把控有一定经验，有一定的抗压能力；\n4、主观能动性强，逻辑分析能力强，具备良好的沟通能力和团队协作能力；\n5、有结构、材料仿真经验优先。","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-11-10T15:02:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false